id=gpu_dvfs_x6886
name=X6886 GPU DVFS governor
version=v1.3.2
versionCode=6
author=lemonrsh
description=GPU floor/ceiling control for MT6789/GED. Volume keys at install choose SAFER (790 MHz rest, 1600 MHz on any GPU or CPU/UI work, 390 MHz screen-off) or MAX (pinned 1600). Single 50 C thermal limit for both; works where /proc/gpufreqv2 is unreadable. Reversible by command or reboot.
